  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 5935534694400
    m_Localized: Your customers are hungry! Come back and fire up the kitchen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5935534694401
    m_Localized: The griddle is hot and the orders are piling up. Time to cook!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5935534694402
    m_Localized: A new day at the restaurant is waiting for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5935534694403
    m_Localized: Your lives are full again. Ready for another shift?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5935534694404
    m_Localized: Hungry guests are lining up outside. Don't keep them waiting!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5935534694405
    m_Localized: Your daily reward is ready to claim!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5935534694406
    m_Localized: Your staff misses you, chef! Come say hi.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5935534694407
    m_Localized: Can you finish the next day with 3 stars?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5935534694408
    m_Localized: Fresh ingredients just arrived. Let's cook something tasty!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5935534694409
    m_Localized: Upgrade your restaurant and make it the talk of the town.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5935534694410
    m_Localized: Boss Hogsworth is asking where the chef went...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5935534694411
    m_Localized: Fries are crispy, burgers are juicy. Come and serve them!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5935534694412
    m_Localized: A little cooking break? Your kitchen is ready when you are.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5935534694413
    m_Localized: Earn coins today and give your kitchen tools a shiny upgrade.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5935534694414
    m_Localized: The lunch rush is starting. Grab your apron!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5935534694415
    m_Localized: Your fame is growing! Keep serving to unlock new rewards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5935534694416
    m_Localized: New customers heard about your cooking. Come and meet them!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5935534694417
    m_Localized: Coffee is brewing and donuts are waiting. Open the café!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5935534694418
    m_Localized: One more day? Your restaurant is calling.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5935534694419
    m_Localized: Serve fast, earn big, and keep every customer smiling!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5935534694420
    m_Localized: Chef, the kitchen needs you! Tap to start cooking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
